+``USE_BLANK_CHOICE_DASH``
+-------------------------
+
+.. versionadded:: 6.1
+.. deprecated:: 6.1
+
+Default: ``True``
+
+Set this transitional setting to ``False`` to opt into the more accessible and
+translatable blank choice label ``"(select an option)"`` instead of
+``"---------"`` in ``<select>`` widgets of model fields, model choice fields,
+and the admin actions dropdown during the Django 6.x release cycle.
+
+This transitional setting is deprecated and will be removed in Django 7.0, when
+the new label becomes the only behavior.
+
