@@ -529,6 +529,13 @@ Features deprecated in 6.1
 Miscellaneous
 -------------
 
+* The ``django.db.models.fields.BLANK_CHOICE_DASH`` constant is deprecated in
+  favor of the new, translatable ``BLANK_CHOICE_LABEL`` constant, which is more
+  accessible for screen readers. The blank choice label will change from
+  ``"---------"`` to ``"(select an option)"`` in Django 7.0. To opt in earlier,
+  set the transitional :setting:`USE_BLANK_CHOICE_DASH` setting to ``False``.
+  The setting is deprecated and will be removed in Django 7.0.
+
